uld be another driving  factor running applications across  regions and even clouds can help ensure  your application remains up and running  just  any outages regulatory requirements also  lend themselves to multiple clusters  especially for multinationals with data  residency requirements and we know that  each cloud has differentiated services  that development teams want to use  making developer choice another  important factor now that we know why  you may need to adopt a multi cluster  strategy let's talk about the  operational challenges of maintaining  multiple clusters across clouds and your  own data centers in most organizations  the platform teams are responsible for  developing custom solutions or cobbling  together open source tooling for  practically everything and this leads to  a lot of friction in adopting a multi  cluster strategy managing the lifecycle  of each cluster using different tooling  from different vendors ensuring uniform  access and governance controls across  the cluster getting insights into your  global set of applications enabling  application teams to efficiently deliver  software to all their clusters and  managing traffic to provide redundancy  and to reduce latency this is what we  set out to solve with anta's let's cover  a few of the multi cluster solutions we  have in Antos anthos gke gives your team  a consistent container management  experience and those config management  unifies access policies and provides  governance across multiple clusters and  those service mesh allows you to set and  monitor a Zillow's on your services  secure traffic between services even  across the cluster boundary and ingress  for anthos allows you to load balanced  external traffic to the closest cluster  to your end-users this helps you to  build low latency and high availability  services in multiple GCP regions to make  it easier to take advantage of these  multi cluster features we are  introducing a concept called &amp; Wine's  VIP admirers you can group related  resources like clusters into a single  management domain once resources are  grouped together in an environmentally  managed multi cluster features and  components across all in line  this simple yet powerful concept allows  you to up level  your management from cluster by cluster  to group of clusters for example within  minds you can now apply and enforce  common policy and config across all in  line members using anthems config  management create a service mesh over  all members of an in mind using a DOS  service mash and even load balance  external traffic into your gke clusters  using ingress for anthos there you have  it  anthos simplifies the adoption of multi  cluster strategy across clouds and  on-prem with the concept of in wines  going forward all multi cluster features  will be managed within wine so expect  more in this space check out the  environment at is's guide linked below  and get started today  for more anthos content don't forget to  subscribe to follow the entire anthos  101 playlist  [Music]
 

